    "enUS": {
      "description": "Can't say I've ever thought much about Alcaz. Near as I can tell, it's an abandoned outpost from the third war of little significance. Never heard nuthin' about a prison there. \r\n\r\nWell, there's nothing for it--we've got to get you in there and see what you can see, especially if there's a chance that the king is there.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Explore Alcaz Prison",
          "type": "monster"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Enter Alcaz Prison and learn what became of the King of Stormwind.",
      "title": "The Secret Prison",
